# Build artifacts for jot-lib.
#
# This mirrors the build-related entries of .cvsignore. It deliberately does
# NOT ignore the model/config files that .cvsignore lists (*.jot, jot.cfg,
# *.sm): unlike the old CVS tree, this repository tracks paperdoll.jot,
# jot.cfg and jot-default.cfg.

# Compiler output. COMP_DIR_BASE defaults to $(JOT_ROOT)/lib, so every object
# file, static library and executable lands under lib/<arch>/<mode>/.
/lib/
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.lib
*.dep

# Local build configuration -- your own copy of doc/Makefile.local and
# doc/setup.bat, per doc/start-here.txt. The templates in doc/ stay tracked.
/Makefile.local
/setup.bat

# Generated documentation (Doxyfile: OUTPUT_DIRECTORY = ./doxygen_docs)
/doxygen_docs/

# Visual Studio per-user and intermediate files
Debug/
*.ncb
*.opt
*.plg
*.suo
*.user
*.exp
*.ilk
*.pdb

# Run-time output: cached silhouette data and screen grabs
*.sil
big_grab*.png

# Editor and OS cruft
*~
.DS_Store

# pycache
*/__pycache__/
